{"lesson_uid":"L0154","_provenance":{"generator":"backend/scripts/generate_lesson_zhuyin.py","reading_authority":"frontend/src/components/zhuyin/polyphonicProcessor.ts（跑，非移植）","source_font":"frontend/public/fonts/BpmfZihiSerif-Regular.ttf","font_sha256_16":"fc25a90d27699ec4","poyin_db_sha256_16":"882bc0ae69aeef35","notation":"pypinyin BopomofoConverter（與 font_readings.json 同一個轉換器）","stats":{"texts":286,"chars":6071,"poly_positions":1581,"he_adjudicated":3,"xiang_adjudicated":1,"manual_corrections":0}},"texts":[{"section":"classical_text","slug":"7qj99","idx":null,"text":"晉平公.問於祁黃羊曰.：「南陽.無令1，其誰可.而為之？」祁黃羊對曰.：「解狐.可。」平公曰.：「解狐.非子之仇邪.？」對曰.：「君.問可，非問.臣之仇也.。」平公曰.：「善.。」遂用之.。國人.稱善焉.。","n":103,"ssz":".....................................................1................................................."},{"section":"classical_text","slug":"7qj99","idx":null,"text":"居有間.2，平公又問祁黃羊曰.：「國.無尉3.，其誰可.而為之.？」對曰.：「午.可.。」平公曰.：「午.非子之子邪.？」對曰.：「君.問可.，非問.臣之子也.。」平公曰.：「善.。」又遂用之.。國人.稱善焉.。","n":106,"ssz":"......................................................1.1....................1............................"},{"section":"classical_text","slug":"7qj99","idx":null,"text":"孔子.聞之曰.：「善哉.，祁黃羊之論也.！外舉.4不避仇，內舉.不避子。祁黃羊可謂.公矣.。」","n":47,"ssz":".........................1......1.............."},{"section":"modern_translation","slug":"phkkj","idx":null,"text":"晉平公問祁黃羊說：「南陽出缺縣令，誰可以擔任這個職位？」祁黃羊答道：「解狐可以。」平公說：「解狐不是你的仇人嗎？」(祁黃羊)回答說：「您問的是(誰)可以，又不是問我的仇人是(誰)。」平公說：「很好！」就任用了解狐。國人都稱讚(任命解狐)好。","n":120,"ssz":".......................1........................1.............................1........................1................"},{"section":"modern_translation","slug":"phkkj","idx":null,"text":"過了一段時間，平公又問祁黃羊說：「國家少一名軍官，誰可以擔任這個職位？」 (祁黃羊)回答說：「祁午可以。」平公說：「祁午不是你的兒子嗎？」 (祁黃羊)回答說：「您問的是(誰)可以，又不是問我的兒子是(誰)。」平公說：「很好！」就又任用了祁午。國人都稱讚(任命祁午)好。","n":134,"ssz":"..1............................1............................1....1.........................1.....1...................................."},{"section":"modern_translation","slug":"phkkj","idx":null,"text":"孔子聽說這件事就說：「祁黃羊的話，說得好啊！推舉外人，不避開仇人；推舉自己人，不避開自己的兒子，祁黃羊可以稱得上是大公無私了。」","n":64,"ssz":"..................1........1...........1......1.......1........."},{"section":"self_challenge","slug":"ftffm","idx":null,"text":"安邑里巷口有賣餅者，吾每早過戶，未嘗不聞其歌。一日，召之與語，貧窘可憐。因與萬錢，令多其本1，日取餅以償之。欣然持錢而去。後過其戶，則寂然不聞謳歌之聲。及呼乃至，謂曰：「爾何輟2歌之遽3乎？」曰：「本流既大，所謀益增，不暇唱曲矣。」(114會)","n":122,"ssz":".........................................................................................................................."},{"section":"served:lesson_code","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"文-L11","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:series","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"文言文","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:title","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"祁黃羊的思路解密","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:reading_strategy","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"文言聚光燈：疑問助詞","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:intro.background","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這篇文章記錄了晉平公向祁黃羊請教，詢問誰適合擔任「南陽令」和「尉」的官職。祁黃羊推薦了兩個人選，但這兩個人選都與祁黃羊有仇或有親屬關係。晉平公對此感到疑惑，但祁黃羊的回答卻讓大家稱讚。孔子聽聞此事後，也讚揚了祁黃羊的見解，認為他能夠不避親仇，公正地舉薦人才，是位真正公正的人。文章透過這個故事，探討了在選拔人才時，應該如何超越個人恩怨與親情，做出最適合的決定。","n":180,"ssz":".............................1..............1......1................................................................1..........................1...................................."},{"section":"served:paragraphs[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"晉平公.問於祁黃羊曰.：「南陽.無令，其誰可.而為之？」祁黃羊對曰.：「解狐.可。」平公曰.：「解狐.非子之仇邪.？」對曰.：「君.問可，非問.臣之仇也.。」平公曰.：「善.。」遂用之.。國人.稱善焉.。","n":102,"ssz":"....................................................1................................................."},{"section":"served:paragraphs[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"居有間.，平公又問祁黃羊曰.：「國.無尉.，其誰可.而為之.？」對曰.：「午.可.。」平公曰.：「午.非子之子邪.？」對曰.：「君.問可.，非問.臣之子也.。」平公曰.：「善.。」又遂用之.。國人.稱善焉.。","n":104,"ssz":"....................................................1.1....................1............................"},{"section":"served:paragraphs[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"孔子.聞之曰.：「善哉.，祁黃羊之論也.！外舉.不避仇，內舉.不避子。祁黃羊可謂.公矣.。」","n":46,"ssz":"........................1......1.............."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[0].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"古文今譯","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[1].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"原文","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[2].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[2].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"文白句子比對","n":6,"ssz":"...1.."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[3].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"二","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[3].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"文白詞語比對","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[4].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"三","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[4].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"文章重點表","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[5].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"四","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[5].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"文言文聚光燈","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[5].subtitle","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"疑問標籤：疑問助詞","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[6].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"五","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[6].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"閱讀理解","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[7].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"六","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[7].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"自我挑戰","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"根據文章，晉平公兩次詢問祁黃羊的目的是什麼？","n":22,"ssz":".................2...."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"想要測試祁黃羊對國家是否忠誠","n":14,"ssz":".............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"想要化解祁黃羊與解狐之間的恩怨","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"尋求合適的人選來填補官職的空缺","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"考驗祁黃羊是否會提拔自己的親信","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"當晉平公問解狐不是他的仇人嗎，祁黃羊的回答展現了什麼樣的態度？","n":31,"ssz":".......1......................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"放下恩怨，與仇人和解","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"對事不對人，只看才幹","n":10,"ssz":"..1......."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"迫於君威，不敢說真話","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"展現自己的寬宏大量","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"孔子對祁黃羊的評價「外舉不避仇，內舉不避子」的核心意義為何？","n":30,"ssz":"............1.....1........1.."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"選拔人才應先考慮親近的人，再考慮仇人","n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"選拔人才應以國家的利益與能力為唯一準則","n":19,"ssz":"..................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"選用人才時必須同時包含仇人和親人，才算公正","n":21,"ssz":"....................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"為了表現公正，即使是仇人也要故意提拔","n":18,"ssz":"1................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"有個養猴子的老人，每天餵猴子橡木果實。一天，他跟猴子們說：「朝三而暮四，足乎？」猴子們聽完都「起而怒」。老人又說：「朝四而暮三，足乎？」猴子們聽完都「伏而喜」。請問：老人這兩種分配果實的說法，有什麼共同點？","n":103,"ssz":".1..1........1...........1...............1...........................1................................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"提供的果實總數都一樣","n":10,"ssz":"........1."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"都成功讓猴子們接受","n":9,"ssz":".....1..."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"都讓猴子們又愛又怒","n":9,"ssz":"...1....."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"讓猴子晚上吃得比較飽","n":10,"ssz":"..1...1..."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「阮宣子論鬼神有無者，或以人死有鬼，宣子獨以為無，曰：『今見鬼者，云著生時衣服，若人死有鬼，衣服復有鬼邪？』」關於上文的理解，下列何者正確？","n":70,"ssz":"...1...............1.................................................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"阮宣子堅信世界上一定有鬼神的存在","n":16,"ssz":"..1.....1......."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"阮宣子用「衣服也有鬼嗎」的疑問，來反駁有鬼的說法","n":24,"ssz":"..1....................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"阮宣子認為鬼喜歡穿著生前最喜歡、最漂亮的衣服出現","n":24,"ssz":"..1....................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"阮宣子和大家一樣，都親眼看過鬼穿著衣服的樣子","n":22,"ssz":"..11..1..............1"},{"section":"served:text_type","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"單","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"橘色代號（字元樣式 aff6）＋ 橘色字元框線（w:bdr E97132／E76D29）＋ 橘色連線（圖形）","n":54,"ssz":"......................................................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"古人沒有「問號 (?)」，沒有「嗎、呢」等「句尾」疑問助詞，也沒有「如何、為什麼、哪裡、怎麼」等「非句尾」的疑問詞，但他們會利用特定的字來表達「疑問」。這就像是句子的「標籤」，看到它們，就知道這是在提問哦！","n":103,"ssz":".....................................1...........................................1....................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一、重點攻略：問句的兩大「標籤」","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我們把疑問句分成兩種最常見的標籤，只要記住位置就很好認：","n":28,"ssz":"............................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].columns[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"標籤字","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].columns[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"意思","n":2,"ssz":".2"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].rows[0][0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"誰、孰（ㄕㄨˊ）","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].rows[0][1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"問「是哪個人」。","n":8,"ssz":"....1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].rows[1][0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"何","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].rows[1][1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"問「什麼」或「為什麼」。","n":12,"ssz":".......1...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].rows[2][0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"安、焉","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].rows[2][1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"問「哪裡」或「怎麼」。","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1. 不是放在句尾的：問題主角\n這些字通常指著某個「人」或「事情」在提問。","n":37,"ssz":"...1..........1.........1............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].instruction#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1. 不是放在句尾的：問題主角","n":15,"ssz":"...1..........1"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].instruction#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這些字通常指著某個「人」或「事情」在提問。","n":21,"ssz":"........1............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].rows[0][0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"乎","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].rows[0][1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"相當於「嗎」。最常出現的疑問詞，可以用於真的提問，也常用於反問。","n":32,"ssz":"1..............................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].rows[1][0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"耶 / 邪（ㄧㄝˊ）","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].rows[1][1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"相當於「嗎、呢」。它通常帶有說話者主觀的猜測、為難或悲傷情感。","n":31,"ssz":"1.............................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].rows[2][0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"與 / 歟（ㄩˊ）","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].rows[2][1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"相當於「吧、呢」。說話者心裡大概有答案，但用一種比較委婉、推測的語氣問。","n":36,"ssz":"1.....................2............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2. 放在句子結尾：語氣標籤(疑問助詞)\n這些字就像我們現在說「嗎」、「呢」，放在句子的最後面。","n":48,"ssz":"......1...................................1....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].instruction#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2. 放在句子結尾：語氣標籤(疑問助詞)","n":20,"ssz":"......1............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].instruction#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這些字就像我們現在說「嗎」、「呢」，放在句子的最後面。","n":27,"ssz":".....................1....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"你可能注意到了，「問題主角」的概念，其實就是我們在〈江乙媽媽告御狀〉裡學過的「疑問代詞」。接下來的練習，可以幫助你更熟悉文言文的疑問句，請務必練習看看。","n":76,"ssz":"............1................1.............................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"二、輕練習","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(一)連連看：請將文言文的「標籤字」與它的白話意思連起來。","n":29,"ssz":"........................2...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"連連看1：","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].left.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"孰","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].right.A","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"嗎","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].right.B","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"誰 / 哪一個","n":7,"ssz":"......1"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].right.C","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"什麼 / 為什麼","n":8,"ssz":".....1.."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"橘色手繪連線（圖形，佈景色 accent2），文