得好啊","n":10,"ssz":".......1.."},{"section":"served:sentence_matching.reference_sentences.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"平公說：「好。」就任用了解狐","n":14,"ssz":"...........1.."},{"section":"served:sentence_matching.reference_sentences.3","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"您問的是(誰)可以，又不是問我的兒子是(誰)","n":22,"ssz":"...........1.....1...."},{"section":"served:sentence_matching.reference_sentences.4","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"您問的是(誰)可以，又不是問我的仇人是(誰)","n":22,"ssz":"...........1.........."},{"section":"served:sentence_matching.reference_sentences.5","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"國人都稱讚好","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:sentence_matching.reference_sentences.6","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"平公說：「很好。」就又任用了祁午","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:sentence_matching.reference_sentences.7","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"過了一段時間，平公又問祁黃羊說","n":15,"ssz":"..1............"},{"section":"served:sentence_matching.reference_sentences.8","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"推舉外人，不避開仇人；推舉自己人，不避開自己的兒子","n":25,"ssz":".....1...........1......1"},{"section":"served:sentence_matching.reference_sentences.9","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"解狐不是你的仇人嗎","n":9,"ssz":"..1......"},{"section":"served:sentence_matching.reference_sentences.10","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"祁午不是你的兒子嗎","n":9,"ssz":"..1....1."},{"section":"served:sentence_matching.reference_sentences.11","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"南陽出缺縣令，誰可以擔任這個職位","n":16,"ssz":".............1.."},{"section":"served:sentence_matching.reference_sentences.12","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"國家少一名軍官，誰可以擔任這個工作","n":17,"ssz":"..............1.."},{"section":"served:sentence_matching.segments[0].classical","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"南陽無令，其誰可而爲之？","n":12,"ssz":"............"},{"section":"served:sentence_matching.segments[1].classical","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"解狐非子之仇邪","n":7,"ssz":"...1..."},{"section":"served:sentence_matching.segments[2].classical","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"君問可，非問臣之仇也","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:sentence_m