,"idx":null,"text":"本錢，做生意的資金。","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.annotations[1].term","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"輟","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.annotations[1].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"ㄔㄨㄛˋ，停止。","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:self_challenge.annotations[2].term","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"遽","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.annotations[2].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"ㄐㄩˋ，突然。","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.translation","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"安邑里巷口有一個賣餅的人。我每天早上經過他家，都能聽到他唱歌。有一天，我叫他來說話，發現他的生活很是貧窮可憐。就給他一萬錢，讓他增加本錢做生意，我再每天跟他拿餅，把餅作為抵債品。他很高興地拿錢走了。後來我經過他家，卻一片安靜，聽不到他唱歌的聲音。就喊他，他才出來，我問他：「你為何突然不唱歌了呢?」他說：「因為做生意的資本變大了，要考慮的事情增加了，沒時間唱歌啊。」","n":183,"ssz":".......1....................................................................................11....................1.......................1...1...........1............................"},{"section":"served:self_challenge.part_one.label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"（一）請依照故事脈絡，回答下列問題。","n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.part_one.answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"橘色手寫（字元樣式 af）；第 3、4 題另有橘色字元框線標出被圈選的答案","n":37,"ssz":"....................................."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.part_one.items[0].stem","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"斷句後的第一個分句，主語是誰？","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.part_one.items[0].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"賣餅者/賣餅的人","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:self_challenge.part_one.items[1].stem","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"承上題，這個主語怎麼樣或做什麼？","n":16,"ssz":".....1.........."},{"section":"served:self_challenge.part_one.items[1].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(早上都在)唱歌","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:self_challenge.part_one.items[2].stem","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「一日，召之與語，貧窘可憐」一句，誰「貧窘可憐」？","n":25,"ssz":"..............1.........."},{"section":"served:sel